            "review_title": "Review at Saj House",
            "review_text": "Полина Х\n5 contributions\n0\nDelicious shawarma in Nha Trang for a penny\nJun 2025 • Family\nCrazy delicious and very cheap.\nThe menu is small. Essentially, they offer three types of shawarma: chicken, meat and falafel. However, they can be \"divided\" into components and produce a huge plate of the same ingredients, just not wrapped in lavash.\nSeparately, there are several salads and hummus-type snacks. There's not much choice of drinks.\nIt's delicious! The tortillas are baked right at the entrance on a traditional oven, the shawarma is picked quickly. Everything is very hot, delicious, and the portions are huge. \nThe establishment employs three people: the owner and two girls. Everyone's very friendly, kind, friendly. \nThe prices are ridiculous. Very cheap. We had dinner for less than VND 100,000.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten June 30, 2025",
