            "review_title": "Review at Saj House",
            "review_text": "Baomix\nAixirivall, Andorra3 contributions\n0\n🌟 A culinary nugget in Nha Trang! 🌟\nMar 2025 • Solo\n🌟 A culinary nugget in Nha Trang! 🌟\n\nI eat regularly at the Saj, and with each visit, Erwan's welcome is warm and kind. From the first bite, you can feel the difference: here, the quality of the products is a priority, and it makes all the difference compared to other restaurants.\n\nErwan's cooking is a real taste journey! His experience in Palestine is felt in every dish, with authentic and refined flavors. From tabbouleh to hummus, everything is a delight! And besides, he always has this delicate attention: as I do not eat bread, he systematically prepares me vegetable sticks to accompany my dishes.\n\nIf you are looking for a place to eat well in a friendly atmosphere in Nha Trang, look no further! The Saj has become for me the reference for healthy, tasty and generous cuisine. A must to test absolutely!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten March 14, 2025",
