            "review_text": "michellebrown2000\nLondon, United Kingdom112 contributions\n0\nSOOOOOO Delicious\nFeb 2025 • Couples\nThe restaurant is closed on a Tuesday as we found out on a Tuesday!! silly us for not checking. The food is so good and super tasty the dips and sauces that come with your meal are so full of flavour and really like you get in the Middle East we had the mixed plate one beef and one chicken which come with a lemon and mint drink which I love we also had some cheese pastries. I can't wait to go back before we leave Nha Trang just writing this makes me hungry for more.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 7, 2025",
